  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Enrolment",
      "items": [
        "A 'request departure/launch' without the startup wording enrols straight into queued with ready = True (1123, 1136-1137).",
        "deck_seen comes from on_deck true and in_air false in telemetry (666-667), or is carried over from an on_deck recovery session (1138-1140).",
        "The departure lane is held from 'released' until launch is observed (_launch frees it at 710)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Transition evidence (file lines)",
      "items": [
        "startup \u2192 queued (pilot: ready for launch): pilot call (1124-1127)",
        "queued \u2192 released (lane: ready, deck_seen, on deck, CASE/altimeter/BRC): ready, deck_seen, on deck, CASE/altimeter/BRC (863-869)",
        "released \u2192 airborne (telemetry: launch from this deck): in_air with deck_seen, or takeoff event (643-647, 666-670)",
        "airborne \u2192 departed (10 nm or departure complete): telemetry HANDOFF_NM (673-675), pilot handoff (1313-1317)",
        "released \u2192 queued (bridge stale: lane freed): _refresh frees lane (453-455)",
        "queued \u2192 airborne (uncleared launch seen): warning notice (709-716)",
        "queued \u2192 closed (no deck_seen or foreign takeoff): no deck_seen or foreign takeoff (643-646, 671-672)",
        "airborne \u2192 closed (land event): 631-633"
      ]
    }
  ]
